>B:<\/b> Not really. It\u2019s <sup>2<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_1\"><\/gap> \u2013 from the 1920s.<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>A:<\/b> That sounds great! Is it attractive?<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>B:<\/b> No! It\u2019s really <sup>3<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_2\"><\/gap>.<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>A:<\/b> Oh no! Well, does it have comfortable furniture?<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>B:<\/b> No \u2013 it\u2019s really <sup>4<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_3\"><\/gap>.<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>A:<\/b> That\u2019s terrible! But is it expensive?<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>B:<\/b> No, the apartment doesn\u2019t cost a lot. It\u2019s <sup>5<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_4\"><\/gap>.<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>A:<\/b> That\u2019s good. Is it a long walk from the university?<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>B:<\/b> No, it isn\u2019t. It\u2019s a <sup>6<\/sup> <gap id=\"gap_5\"><\/gap> walk \u2013 about five minutes.<\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><b>Listen and check your answers.<\/b><\/p><p class=\"ql-align-justify\"><audio-player id=\"audio-player_0\"><\/audio-player><\/p>"],"globalTypesConfigs":[{"type":"gap","widthMode":"asLongestWord","longestAlternativeSolutions":false,"ignoreCaseSensitivity":false}],"wordbox":{"interactive":true,"distractors":[],"backgroundColor":"lightgray","textAlign":"center","fontColor":"black"}}]}